// Copy this file to Config.xcconfig and fill in your Supabase project.
// Config.xcconfig is gitignored: the anon key is public by design, but a
// project URL still identifies the customer's data, and the file is the
// obvious place someone will one day paste a service-role key by mistake.
//
// The service-role key must NEVER appear in this app. It bypasses every
// row-level security policy in 0002_rls.sql. It belongs only in the Edge
// Function, where Supabase injects it server-side.

SUPABASE_URL = https:/$()/YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = your-anon-key
